   668   * <pre>
   669   * Notes:
   670   *      (1) The widths are alternating black/white, starting with black
   671   *          and ending with black.
   672   *      (2) The optional best decoding window width is the width of the window
   673   *          that is used to make a decision about whether a transition occurs.
   674   *          It is approximately the average width in pixels of the narrowest
